              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Line infantry have hand weapon, throwing spear and shield. Line Infantry: up to one unit in three may exchange throwing spear and shield for 2 handed mace- axe (free).</characteristic>
