                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Libyans have Hand weapon and javelins. Light Infantry. Warband (rule 2 does not apply) Nubians have Hand weapon and short bow. Skirmishers Slingers have Hand weapon and sling. Option: may have buckler (free) Skirmishers</characteristic>
